VMEC++ single-file amalgamation
===============================

This is an unofficial redistribution of VMEC++ in single-translation-unit form.
It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Proxima Fusion.

Components
----------

VMEC++  -  https://github.com/proximafusion/vmecpp
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024-present Proxima Fusion GmbH.
    Amalgamated from the commit named on the Provenance line at the head of
    vmecpp_amalgamated.cc. The sources are inlined with only mechanical
    transformations: project headers are pasted in dependency order, and two
    optional paths are compiled out, the FFTX/SPIRAL transform (guarded by
    VMECPP_USE_FFTX), which leaves the partial-DFT path VMEC++ uses when FFTX
    is off, and the Enzyme autodiff translation units (guarded by
    VMECPP_ENABLE_ENZYME). No algorithmic changes were made.
    vmecpp_amalgamated.min.cc holds the same sources with comments and
    indentation removed; the per-file SPDX and copyright headers it drops are
    restated in the single notice at its head. upstream/ holds VMEC++'s
    README.md, VMECPP_NAMING_GUIDE.md, docs/fourier_basis_implementation.md
    and AGENTS.md files with the CLAUDE.md links to them, copied from the same
    commit at their paths in the repository; a relative link in them to a file
    not copied is rewritten to point at that file in the repository at that
    commit.

abscab  -  https://github.com/jonathanschilling/abscab-cpp
    Apache License, Version 2.0, Copyright (c) Jonathan Schilling.
    abscab/abscab.hh and abscab/abscab.cc (commit 5cfa473b, tag v1.0.3) are
    inlined unmodified. A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is at
    THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/abscab-Apache-2.0.txt.

Pull request discussions  -  https://github.com/proximafusion/vmecpp/pulls
    vmecpp_unmerged_prs.txt reproduces the titles, descriptions, comments and
    reviews of the repository's open and unmerged closed pull requests as
    posted on GitHub. Each post remains the work of its author and is not
    covered by the licenses above.

Build-time dependencies, fetched or found at build time and not redistributed
in this repository: Eigen, abseil-cpp, nlohmann/json, HDF5, NetCDF, OpenMP.
Each remains under its own license.
